-- Florida limited-entry quota hunts: permits still available plus permits returned and reissued first come.
-- The page lists this year's hunt types with IDs that change every year, so each check reads the ID off the page first.
-- Spring turkey is left out: before its draw every hunt shows its full quota as available.
